asked for: "whoever can reach s3://zenfuzz should re-run those artifacts against main".
R2 credentials were present this time (~/.config/cloudflare/r2-credentials), and the
farm keys its crash directories by the LOCAL-MIRROR hash in the issue body
(`/mnt/v/fuzzes/_farm/crashes/.../<hash>`), not by the `Signature` hash:

    s3://zenfuzz/crashes/rav1d-safe/<target>/<arch>/<mirror-hash>/
        crash-<sha1>      one file per artifact (hundreds per signature)
        meta.json         signature, first artifact, trace tail
        repro.txt         the farm's own `cargo fuzz run` transcript


